      "title": "Directions",
      "goal": "Give and follow simple directions.",
      "notes": [
        "sajje and khabbe already mean \"to the right\" and \"to the left\" — no extra preposition needed.",
        "itthe (here) and utthe (there) pair with kitthe (where). Same ending, easy to remember together."
