    {
      "id": "u7l3",
      "title": "In the market",
      "goal": "Ask a price, push back on it, and close the deal.",
      "notes": [
        "Bargaining is expected in a bazar and is friendly, not confrontational.",
        "thorha ghatt karo — \"make it a little less\" — is the polite opening move."
